 contractor floor with admin-only override, contractor never below store cost

Tom approved by voice, Nov 16 2026 11:54 AM CT; store-cost reading confirmed 11:55 AM CT.

- shared/priceFloors.ts: floor constants (11500 / 13800), clamps, write-time checks
- resolveAffiliateStorefrontSale: clamp retail to yourCost x1.15 (covers bad stored markups and 0% list_discount tiers)
- sellPriceForTier / contractorPriceOverAffiliateCost: homeowner >= 1.15, contractor >= max(store cost, 1.38 or admin override, 1.15); wholesale unchanged
- contractorAccess.setAffiliateMarkup: reject below-floor saves server-side; admin-only adminOverrideMultiplier (1.15..1.38) stored in contractor_price_overrides history
- affiliates update/upsert markup (affiliate + admin): reject retail markups under cost x1.15
- recalculateStoredTierPrices: cached homeowner/contractor columns honor the floors
- Floors read from pricing_settings.minMarginOverCostBps / contractorRecommendedBps with 1.15 / 1.38 fallbacks
- docs/sql/0281_price_floor_enforcement.tidb.sql (hand-run, NOT run)
